    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883270/extras/73496a6a30068dbe94988ee620d8b59d.poster.avif?t=1663163473\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883270/extras/73496a6a30068dbe94988ee620d8b59d.webm?t=1663163473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883270/extras/73496a6a30068dbe94988ee620d8b59d.mp4?t=1663163473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The Final Rescue is an escape puzzle room game with the mechanics of rotating rooms.<br>You are the only survivor. You found out that a scientist was working on an antidote. In hope of finding something, you visit his house.<br><br>Game contains mysterious rooms, exciting puzzles and a great story. You need to solve puzzles, collect items to unlock doors, items .You have two options to select game style.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883270/extras/0040eaeeed53308be6e4215d1de043d6.poster.avif?t=1663163473\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883270/extras/0040eaeeed53308be6e4215d1de043d6.webm?t=1663163473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883270/extras/0040eaeeed53308be6e4215d1de043d6.mp4?t=1663163473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Features :<br>- Addictive gameplay and compelling storyline.<br>- Two gameplay styles.<br>- An exciting point-and-click game.<br>- Investigate the various locations from the mysterious rooms to the warehouse in 3D.<br>- Filled with classic puzzle games.<br>- Find hidden clues and objects to move to the next location.<br>- Complete logical tasks to explore the world.<br>- Embark on an adventurous journey to make discoveries at every step.<br>- Challenge the detective in you with our escape room puzzles.<br>- Enjoy the addictive graphics of our colorful 3D world.<br><br><br>What is an escape room?<br><br>An escape room is a game in which a player discovers clues and solves puzzles in one or more rooms to accomplish the task. The task is often to escape from the site of the game.<br>The final rescue offers you the thrill of playing the classic escape room with the twists of our tiny mysterious virtual world.",
